{
  "name": "happy",
  "integration": "trend-vision-one",
  "description": "One page of the endpoint inventory with the adapter pass off. Proves the top page-size parameter is sent, that ids are namespaced by the regional API host, that loopback, link-local and unspecified addresses are stripped from ipAddresses while lastUsedIp is kept off the interface entirely (it is the NAT/Service Gateway egress address shared by every endpoint behind it), that the Trend agent products become Software rows, that a row with no agentGuid is skipped with a log line, and that a non-object element in items is dropped rather than aborting the run.",
